<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<!--
(c)John Lewis - 2021
XML to build JavaFX menu

menuEntry type  - menuItem          insert menu item into the menu
                - separator         insert menu separator
                - subMenu           insert a sub menu
                - checkmenuitem     insert checkmenuitem

menuItem option - text              chromispos.properties entry to use
                - shortCutKey1      key char to be used (must be assigned along with shortCutKey2)
                - shortCutKey2      valid options for shortCutKey2 &  shortCutKey3 ALT_ANY, ALT_DOWN, CONTROL_ANY,
                - shortCutKey3      CONTROL_DOWN, META_ANY, META_DOWN, SHIFT_ANY, SHIFT_DOWN
                - permissionclass   the class used the rolepermissions table to allow this action, if the class
                                    is not present in user list the menuitem will not be display. If the option is not present
                                    the menuItem will be displayed regardless of permissions

                - actionClass       the class of the action to run upon selection
                - accessName        the access name used in roles to execute the class
                - previousClass     This is required to maintain backward compatability
                - actionMethod      the method within the above class to run
                - directAction      A direct java action for example System.exit(0)
                - alwaysAvailable   The item line will always be enabled regardless of permissions

-->

